    "title": "GATEWAY_PROD_OAuth Token Retrieval API",
    "description": "The OAuth Token Retrieval API provides a secure mechanism for users and applications to obtain OAuth tokens used for authentication and authorization. By leveraging this API, developers can seamlessly access protected resources on behalf of users, ensuring compliance with security standards. Typical consumers include frontend applications and backend services that require user authentication to interact with various APIs. This endpoint is an essential component of the OAuth 2.0 protocol implementation, making it fundamental for secure API access.",
